im] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]report-additions: add suggest, default, bounds, line, filled, per-choice[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts, dated_notes, legacy, and a semantic schema fingerprint to album [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list JSON, and emit the record block in Obsidian's YAML sequence style [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with round-trip fixtures.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bob albums update writer[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]schema-writer[dim] · [dim][/dim]after report-additions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-writer: add bob albums update with a JSON ops envelope, dry-run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diffs and impact counts, a fingerprint guard, Rust-side validation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]span-preserving emit, one scoped transactional commit with index [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rebuild, typed refusals, and inverse ops.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Collapsed schema summary, chip view, and read-only Schema Card[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]header-reshape[dim] · [dim][/dim]after report-additions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]header-reshape: reshape the album header's schema surface into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collapsed-by-default summary line, an expandable chip view with usage [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts, a read-only Schema Card modal, and a YAML jump with lint marks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from bob's issues.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Editable Schema Card gestures with consequences and Undo[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]card-editor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after header-reshape, schema-writer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-editor: make the Schema Card keyboard-first editable through bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]albums update, with per-gesture dry-run consequence lines, scoped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commits, an inverse-ops Undo, taught refusals, and palette, Command [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Mode, and record-note entry points.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kr","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-kr.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-kr.1"},"source_run_id":"run-ea56da737ffe24549232b0e3d7633354","started_at":"2026-11-12T12:02:26.909083+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"88dfd7ecb2f869faf86c1e874094beb24d035362b12596e4d78f97dfa107269e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"6a188b334749bf51f8c67d85228b0cf6d9b796eef2626595206c86b0f73145c5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.land/meta.json","size_bytes":707},"prompt":{"digest":"5ba1d6f7bd7272c2f5ff69f120611513d3879183ecb5bd4c5a83776b221cbb4d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":273},"state":{"digest":"997fa37af1363010a2ca70bf2d62dd46bfe84123d983b9abe835a57ff4b030c3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-kr.land","local_name":"bob-cli-kr.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-kr","agent_clan_generation":"20261112070132","bead_id":"bob-cli-kr","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kr","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-kr.1","bob-cli-kr.2","bob-cli-kr.3","bob-cli-kr.4"]},"source_run_id":"r